   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"setup\"></a>\n",
    "## 1. Setup & Environment\n",
    "Configure the notebook runtime, set reproducible random seeds, configure modern aesthetics, and dynamically detect execution paths.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"import_libraries\"></a>\n",
    "### 1.1 Import Libraries\n",
    "We import `pandas` for tabular data manipulation, `numpy` for numerical calculations, `matplotlib` and `seaborn` for visualizations, and `pathlib` for flexible cross-platform path resolution.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:13.155171Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-03T08:15:13.155171Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-03T08:15:15.892846Z",
