   "source": [
    "<a name=\"class_balance\"></a>\n",
    "### 2.6 Target Class Balance Analysis\n",
    "A critical step in machine learning is assessing class balance.\n",
    "- An imbalanced dataset can cause a model to predict only the majority class.\n",
    "- Here we analyze the distribution of `TARGET` (Phishing = `1` vs. Benign = `0`) and verify our stratified partitioning strategy.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:16.556682Z",
