   "source": [
    "<a name=\"sec3_2\"></a>\n",
    "### 3.2 Visualization and Analysis of Each Feature\n",
    "In this section, we visualize each feature and analyze its characteristics, skewness, distribution evenness, and separation ability.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"sec3_2_1\"></a>\n",
    "#### 3.2.1 Skewness & Distribution Evenness Assessment\n",
    "We evaluate the Fisher-Pearson skewness coefficient for all 10 features:\n",
    "- **Evenly Distributed / Symmetrical**: $|\\text{Skewness}| < 0.5$\n",
    "- **Moderately Skewed**: $0.5 \\le |\\text{Skewness}| \\le 1.0$\n",
    "- **Highly Skewed / Heavy-Tailed**: $|\\text{Skewness}| > 1.0$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
