   "source": [
    "<a name=\"sec3_2_7\"></a>\n",
    "#### 3.2.7 Comprehensive Evenness Table & Correlation Heatmap\n",
    "We summarize the descriptive evenness across all 10 features and compute their Pearson correlation with `TARGET`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
