  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"sec5_3\"></a>\n",
    "### 5.3 Training the Model\n",
    "We split the training data into training data and validation data using a **70/30 stratified holdout split** (`stratify=y`). This evaluates generalization performance on unseen validation data.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.391222Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.391222Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.400641Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.400641Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Train size: 8,103 samples | Validation size: 3,474 samples\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Split the standardized training data into 70% train and 30% validation\n",
    "X_train, X_valid, y_train, y_valid = train_test_split(\n",
    "    X_std, y, test_size=0.3, stratify=y, random_state=0\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Train size: {X_train.shape[0]:,} samples | Validation size: {X_valid.shape[0]:,} samples\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Now, let's create and train models with:\n",
    "1. **Logistic Regression**\n",
    "2. **Decision Tree**\n",
    "3. **Random Forest**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.402651Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.402651Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.431076Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.431076Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Logistic Regression Validation ROC-AUC: 0.9767 | Accuracy: 0.9142\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Model 1: Logistic Regression\n",
    "lr = LogisticRegression(class_weight=\"balanced\", max_iter=1000, random_state=0)\n",
    "lr.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "lr_val_auc = roc_auc_score(y_valid, lr.predict_proba(X_valid)[:, 1])\n",
    "lr_val_acc = accuracy_score(y_valid, lr.predict(X_valid))\n",
    "print(f\"Logistic Regression Validation ROC-AUC: {lr_val_auc:.4f} | Accuracy: {lr_val_acc:.4f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.433613Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.433613Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.463713Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.463713Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Decision Tree Validation ROC-AUC: 0.9971 | Accuracy: 0.9845\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Model 2: Decision Tree\n",
    "dt = DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=6, min_samples_leaf=20, class_weight=\"balanced\", random_state=0)\n",
    "dt.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "dt_val_auc = roc_auc_score(y_valid, dt.predict_proba(X_valid)[:, 1])\n",
    "dt_val_acc = accuracy_score(y_valid, dt.predict(X_valid))\n",
    "print(f\"Decision Tree Validation ROC-AUC: {dt_val_auc:.4f} | Accuracy: {dt_val_acc:.4f}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-03T08:15:23.465723Z",
